&Q000792

{1 = 1-9}
1.	@wPN{Nibruta-lu}, 
2.	the son of the merchant @wPN{Lugal-šuba}, 
3.	has had this tin axe made for @wDN{Nergal}. 
4.	Its wooden part is of @fsux{arganum} tree of the mountains, 
5.	a wood which is superior even to the @fsux{alal} stone; 
6.	its stone part is of @fsux{antasura}, 
7.	a stone which has no equal. 
8.	The arm of the man who  
9.	strikes with it will never get tired. 

{10 = 10-16}
10.	Should it break, 
11.	I will repair it for @wDN{Nergal}. 
12.	Should it disappear, 
13.	I will replace it for him. 
14.	May @wDN{Nergal} look after me during my life, 
15.	and may he provide me with clean  
16.	water in the underworld after my death. 
